--- !u!114 &827627902
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 827627900}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.17, g: 0.11, b: 0.08, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 12
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<size=14><b><color=#4F7F35>Fases e mapas</color></b></size>\n\u2022 A cada 10 ondas o mapa muda e os p\xE1ssaros v\xEAm por outro caminho.\n\u2022 Na troca, todos os porcos voltam para a carteira pelo valor inteiro: monte a defesa de novo.\n\n<size=14><b><color=#4F7F35>Porcos</color></b></size>\n\u2022 Clique num porco para melhorar (U), mudar a mira ou vender (Delete, devolve 70%).\n\u2022 O arp\xE3o atravessa a fila; a bomba pega bandos e a coura\xE7a do urubu.\n\u2022 No c\xEDrculo do Tamboreiro, os porcos atiram mais r\xE1pido.\n\n<size=14><b><color=#4F7F35>Atalhos</color></b></size>\n\u2022 P pausa \xB7 F acelera (1\xD7, 2\xD7, 3\xD7)\n\u2022 Esc abre o menu \xB7 clique direito cancela"
